  "description": "AI document scanner for the Shiny Blazor CameraView. Detects that a document is present in a frame in-browser (no OCR), then sends just that one cropped frame to a Microsoft.Extensions.AI IChatClient for structured data extraction — so the model only runs on real documents, not every frame. Works with any IChatClient and any strongly-typed payload via MEAI structured output.",
